{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33812","headline":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 渔梁 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望渔具十五咏 渔梁","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"波际插翠筠，离离似清籞。\n游鳞到溪口，入此无逃所。\n斜临杨柳津，静下鸬鷀侣。\n编此欲何之，终焉富春渚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33812.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33812","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}